{"id":"50694dc705d2290e","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph.md","title":"thm-atm-characterizes-ph (ATM Characterizes PH)","display":"thm-atm-characterizes-ph (ATM Characterizes PH)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-atm]]","[[28-df-ph]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-pi-k-p]]"],"display":"thm-atm-characterizes-ph (ATM Characterizes PH)","label":"28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph","ATM Characterizes PH","Bounded Alternation Characterization of PH"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9efd20f439611336\" href=\"?note=9efd20f439611336\" title=\"28-df-atm\">28-df-atm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3490cd4d54ac2474\" href=\"?note=3490cd4d54ac2474\" title=\"28-df-ph\">28-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-atm-characterizes-ph (ATM Characterizes PH)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph</span><span>ATM Characterizes PH</span><span>Bounded Alternation Characterization of PH</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(t_a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_a(n)=(n+2)^a\">\\(t_a(n)=(n+2)^a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t,k)\">\\(\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t,k)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t,k)\">\\(\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t,k)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9efd20f439611336\" href=\"?note=9efd20f439611336\" title=\"28-df-atm\">28-df-atm</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 计非停机状态的交替块数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\">\\(\\mathbf{PH}\\)</span> 见相应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}&amp;=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t_a,k),\\\\\n\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}&amp;=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t_a,k),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PH}&amp;=\\bigcup_{k,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\left(\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t_a,k)\\cup\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t_a,k)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}&amp;=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t_a,k),\\\\\n\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}&amp;=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t_a,k),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PH}&amp;=\\bigcup_{k,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\left(\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t_a,k)\\cup\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t_a,k)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：原书将模拟证明留作习题；本次没有独立完成全部 ATM 与量词块模拟。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>量词串转 ATM 时按每块状态标签选择多项式长的赋值后运行确定型谓词。反向按机器的块次记录各块选择串，并用确定型模拟检查它们形成的分支及最终结果；填充未用选择保持固定多项式长度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 块是至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k-1\">\\(k-1\\)</span> 次切换，首层只有一个块。原书把证明留作习题5.2，本次未独立展开所有模拟细节。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义5.8、断言5.9；印刷100页；PDF126页。陈述和块数换算已核对，原书证明留作习题5.2。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-atm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"3490cd4d54ac2474","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pi-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4265180c3d2ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-atm","status":"resolved","id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$t_a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$t_a(n)=(n+2)^a$，$a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t,k)$、$\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t,k)$ 见 [[28-df-atm]]，$k$ 计非停机状态的交替块数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"t_a:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"t_a(n)=(n+2)^a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t,k)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}&=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t_a,k),\\\\\n\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}&=\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t_a,k),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PH}&=\\bigcup_{k,a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\left(\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\exists(t_a,k)\\cup\\mathbf{ATIME}_\\forall(t_a,k)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k-1","display":false}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层级关系：[[28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph]]、[[28-thm-ph-contained-pspace]]、[[28-thm-ph-collapse]]、[[28-thm-karp-lipton]]。"}],"outgoing":["9efd20f439611336","3490cd4d54ac2474","e4f9f10bc85fd486","2bc4265180c3d2ff"]}